{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1332050-demonlight-post-some-useful-short-cuts-or-players-don-t-want-to-read","id":1332050,"title":"Demonlight post some useful short cuts (Or, players don't want to read.)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-21T18:33:29-07:00","id":1332050,"title":"Demonlight post some useful short cuts (Or, players don't want to read.)","content":"So, if your players are anything like mine, getting them to read Exalted can be daunting. Looking though pages of charms, artifacts, spells, merits, martial arts, and lore can be super challenging.<br /> <br /> So I wrote everything out in a simple basic non-system way to help people build concepts and then be able to hunt down the information easier.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=16Vvak_OaAKIyvM3-47WCCejBOL4HtZni\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=16V...WCCejBOL4HtZni</a> This links to the collective folder.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DTCkO6Vq7-miMxj7VxePc-hOFPXjNH8a178EoYyrTZU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a> This is charms any Solar can get at Essence 1.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jJrKDnXSYsDgkCxGXUc6CYT5pSGJ-nZn9RkMr0eM9dE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a> This is Charms broken into charm trees based on capstones. It contains some advice for new players and some tips. It is the largest document.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G7669akhxc-MwoadN-2NBWe27nB_27EpGxYvc1FlWwQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a> Merits and mutations.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Bg9_X9Sf6vXFBlknCVvAPiHSoowmNaz3o2MDLX_8Zec/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a> Sorcery spells, shaping rituals and basic information on Sorcerous workings so you don't forget.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P7XMlTq47B6IoJld660krvNubbZa2J6BpFrRgixMBEA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a> for Martial arts.<br /> <br /> I am still working on these so any feed back would be great. Sorcery includes stuff from <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/273671/The-Thousand-Sanctioned-Beasts---Sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\">The Thousand Sanctioned Beasts </a></b> Otherwise all books include information from Lunars manuscript for backs, Dragonblooded, Arms of the Chosen, and Miracle of the sun or whatever . Basically everything.<br /> <br /> Edit: This is made for Essence 1 Solars, and assumes Mastery effects and Supernal in higher essence charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4390,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4390-deamonlight","user":"Deamonlight","date":". 08-21-2019, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4390-deamonlight","name":"Deamonlight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-27T04:18:33-07:00","id":1332800,"title":"","content":"oy that's cool thank you !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2429